How do we get our cities to create NO waste. Things either need to be fully [[compostable|Compost]] or fully [[recycleable|Recycle]]. There is no waste.

[[The 3Rs]] are related to getting to this place.

Conservation of all resources. No discharge to land, water, or air!?

!! UW principles

* universality / can't exclude anyone; increase all access
* equity / reallocate resources where they've been divested
* participation / get to help decide; offer options
* transparency / understand how things work; how they're being implemented (honesty?)
* accountability / people need to be held accountable.

!! Zero-waste

* cleaner air
* cleaner communities
* safer communities
* more jobs
* less waste
* reduce reliance on "away" which often means poorer communities; even locally.

